  {
   "id": "d1_foot",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 940,
   "width": 1509.2000000000003,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 100055,
   "updated": 1,
   "boundElements": null,
   "text": "The runtime path never writes: queries open index-<sha>.db read-only and it is never mutated in place.  Publishing flips a small `current` pointer via os.replace (POSIX rename(2)),\nso a query already reading the old file is never interrupted \u2014 there is no downtime window.  The package graph is rebuilt, not accumulated: each reindex retracts that repo's own stale edges first.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The runtime path never writes: queries open index-<sha>.db read-only and it is never mutated in place.  Publishing flips a small `current` pointer via os.replace (POSIX rename(2)),\nso a query already reading the old file is never interrupted \u2014 there is no downtime window.  The package graph is rebuilt, not accumulated: each reindex retracts that repo's own stale edges first.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
